    },
    6023: {
        "name": 'On a small, grassy field',
        "desc": 'You are in a small, grassy field somewhere in the forest.  The tall grass\nnearly reaches your waist, and the surrounding oaks and beeches form an almost\nwall-like thicket on all sides of the field.  A small path leads south through\nthe trees.',
