        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
        "extra_descs": [('tree trees trunk trunks', 'These ancient trees must have been here for many, many years.  It is impossible\nto catch even a glimpse of anything above the lowest branches.'), ('trail', 'The dark and dusty trail seems fragile compared to the massive trunks, and in\nsome places, giant grey roots have broken up through its surface.')],
    },
    6130: {
        "name": 'A narrow trail through the deep, dark forest',
        "desc": 'You are on a dusty trail winding its way westwards just below huge sticky\nwires suspended like ropes between the trees.  To the west the path seems to\nbe completely covered in a giant web made from huge threads covered with glue.\nThis place gives you the creeps.',
        "exits": {
            "e": {"to": 6144, "desc": 'The narrow, dusty trail leads east through the forest, away from the web.'},
            "w": {"to": 6131, "desc": 'The structure to the west looks most of all like an immense spider web.\nIt does not look as if you can go further without getting caught in it.'},
            "u": 6132,
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
        "extra_descs": [('substance wire wires rope ropes tree trees trunk trunks', 'The sticky substance is hanging like ropes between the ancient trees, crossing\nthe path just out of reach.  It might be possible to climb one of the sticky\ntrunks.'), ('trail', 'The dark and dusty trail seems fragile compared to the massive trunks, and in\nsome places, giant grey roots have broken up through its surface.')],
    },
    6131: {
        "name": 'The spider web',
        "desc": "You are walking along the narrow path, ducking under the sticky ropes as you\nadvance...\n\n>\nA huge, poisonous spider drops from above!\nA huge, poisonous spider drops from above!\nA huge, poisonous spider drops from above!\n\n>\nThe huge, poisonous spider stings you!  You resist the poison!\nThe huge, poisonous spider stings you!  You are poisoned!\nThe huge, poisonous spider stings you!  You are poisoned!\n\n>\nYou've fallen, and you can't get up!!!!!",
        "exits": {
        },
        "flags": {"no_mob": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
    },
    6132: {
        "name": 'Up in the tree',
        "desc": 'You are hanging on the outside of a huge tree trunk covered in a sticky\nsubstance.  Directly to the west is an immense spider web suspended between\nnumerous of the giant trees including the one you are hanging on.',
        "exits": {
            "w": {"to": 6133, "desc": 'To the west is the immense spider web.  It seems to move softly.'},
            "d": {"to": 6130, "desc": 'Downwards is the narrow forest path.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "no_mob": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'swim',
        "extra_descs": [('web', 'The spider web stretches out to the west.  It looks as if it is possible to\nwalk on it.')],
    },
    6133: {
        "name": 'On the spider web',
        "desc": 'You are balancing carefully on the giant sticky threads that holds the giant\nweb in place.  To the east is a giant tree trunk and to the west is an entrance\nto a cave-like structure made from many layers of spider web.',
        "exits": {
            "n": {"to": 6200, "desc": 'The web continues to the north.'},
            "e": {"to": 6132, "desc": 'To the east is the giant tree trunk.'},
            "w": {"to": 6134, "desc": 'To the west is the entrance to the cave-like structure.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'swim',
        "extra_descs": [('cave structure', 'It covers a ground area corresponding to an irregular circle with a diameter of\nabout 20 feet and is nearly 10 feet tall.  It looks very old.'), ('web', 'The immense spider web moves softly.')],
    },
    6134: {
        "name": 'The Den of the Queen Spider',
        "desc": 'You are inside a cave-like structure that seems to be made entirely from\ncountless layers of spider web.  Temperature and humidity is very high making\nit hard to breathe the foul air that lingers here.  The walls are covered with\nopen cocoons.',
        "exits": {
            "e": {"to": 6133, "desc": 'Compared to this place the east exit looks inviting.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'swim',
        "extra_descs": [('cocoon cocoons', 'The cocoons are burst open as if something inside really wanted to get out.\nThey are at the size of a human head.'), ('web wall walls', 'The sticky walls are covered with open cocoons.')],
    },
    6135: {
        "name": 'A dusty trail in the deep, dark forest',
        "desc": 'You are on a dusty trail leading through the deep, dark forest.  Ancient grey\ntrees loom all around you.  The trail continues north and east.',
        "exits": {
            "n": {"to": 6136, "desc": 'The dusty trail leads north through the trees.'},
            "e": {"to": 6129, "desc": 'The dusty trail leads east through the trees.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
        "extra_descs": [('tree trees trunk trunks', 'The ancient grey giants seem to observe you silently.')],
    },
    6136: {
        "name": 'A dusty trail in the deep, dark forest',
        "desc": 'You are on a dusty trail leading through the deep, dark forest.  Ancient,\ngrey trees loom everywhere.  The trail continues south and west.  A broad\nirregular path leads eastwards away from the trail.',
        "exits": {
            "e": {"to": 6142, "desc": 'The trees standing on the sides of the path have scratch marks on them.'},
            "s": {"to": 6135, "desc": 'The dusty trail leads south through the trees.'},
            "w": {"to": 6137, "desc": 'The dusty trail leads west through the trees.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
        "extra_descs": [('trail', 'The dark and dusty trail seems fragile compared to the massive trunks, and in\nsome places, giant grey roots have broken up through its surface.'), ('path', 'The trees standing on the sides of the path have scratch marks on them.'), ('tree trees trunk trunks', 'To the east the ancient grey giants have many marks as if something with huge\nclaws has been tearing at them in rage.')],
    },
    6137: {
        "name": 'At the end of the trail through the deep, dark forest',
        "desc": 'You are on a dusty trail leading through the deep, dark forest.  Ancient grey\ntrees loom all around you.  You see a dark grove north of you.\nThe only other exit is east.',
        "exits": {
            "n": {"to": 1300, "desc": 'You see a dark grove north.'},
            "e": {"to": 6136, "desc": 'The dusty trail leads east through the trees.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
        "extra_descs": [('tree trees trunk trunks', 'The ancient grey giants seem to observe you silently.')],
    },
    6142: {
        "name": 'Outside a cave in the deep, dark forest',
        "desc": 'You are at the end of a broad, irregular path.  To the north is a very large\nominous-looking cave opening.  The trees here have many marks as if something\nwith huge claws has been tearing at them in rage.',
        "exits": {
            "n": {"to": 6143, "desc": 'The disgusting smell of a large reptile emanates from the cave opening.'},
            "w": {"to": 6136, "desc": 'The path winds its way westwards.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
        "extra_descs": [('cave opening', 'The disgusting smell of a large reptile emanates from the cave opening.'), ('tree trees', 'The ancient grey giants have many marks as if something with huge claws has\nbeen tearing at them in rage.')],
    },
    6143: {
        "name": 'The cave of the Green Dragon',
        "desc": 'You are in a big natural cave.  The floor is littered with bones of all sorts\nand the stench is so massive that you could cut it with a knife.  The only exit\nis to the south.',
        "exits": {
            "s": {"to": 6142, "desc": 'The exit leads out into the forest.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
        "extra_descs": [('bone bones floor', 'Most of the bones on the floor appear to be of human origin.')],
    },
    6144: {
        "name": 'A small path in the deep, dark forest',
        "desc": 'You are on a narrow path leading through the deep, dark forest.  Ancient,\ngrey trees loom everywhere.  The tree trunks here seem to be covered in some\nsticky substance.  The path continues south and west.',
        "exits": {
            "s": {"to": 6110, "desc": 'The narrow path winds its way through the trees to the south.'},
            "w": {"to": 6130, "desc": 'The narrow path winds its way through the trees to the west.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
        "extra_descs": [('path', 'The path seems all too frail.  One of the giant roots could probably crush it\nin a single blow.'), ('tree trees trunk trunks', 'The ancient grey giants seem to observe you silently.'), ('substance rope ropes thread threads', 'The substance reminds you of giant threads covered with glue.  If it had not\nbeen for the size you could have sworn it was part of a spider web.')],
    },
    6150: {
        "name": 'The narrow trail.',
        "desc": 'This trail looks much spookier than any other thats you have seen.  The usual\nanimal claw marks and bites on the trees are getting far and few between. The\ntrail continues north.',
        "exits": {
            "n": {"to": 6151, "desc": 'the narrow trail continues north.'},
            "s": {"to": 6103, "desc": 'the trail intersects the main forest path.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
    },
    6151: {
        "name": 'The narrow trail.',
        "desc": 'This area of the trail is also very peculiar.  You can see no signs of animal\nlife what so ever.  The structure of the surrounding trees forces the path to\nmake a sharp turn to the east.',
        "exits": {
            "e": {"to": 6152, "desc": 'the trail bends east.'},
            "s": {"to": 6150, "desc": 'the start of the trail.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
    },
    6152: {
        "name": 'The circle of trees.',
        "desc": 'The trees here seem to form a circle around a HUGE tree that is in the center\nof them.  You notice a wooden door carved into the huge tree to the east.  The\ntrail that you followed to get here seems to end at the base of the tree.',
        "exits": {
            "e": {"to": 6153, "desc": 'The tree door is carved beautifully.', "keyword": 'door', "isdoor": True, "closed": True},
            "w": {"to": 6151, "desc": 'the bend on the trail.', "isdoor": True},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
    },
    6153: {
        "name": 'Inside the great tree.',
        "desc": 'You have stepped inside of this hollowed tree.  From here steps lead down into\ndarkness or you can exit the tree by going west.',
        "exits": {
            "w": {"to": 6152, "desc": 'the door is carved beautifully.', "keyword": 'door', "isdoor": True, "closed": True},
            "d": {"to": 6154, "desc": 'The steps look appear like they will hold your weight.'},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
    },
    6154: {
        "name": 'The underground hallway.',
        "desc": 'This hallway is apparently one of the roots of the tree hollowed out.  The hall\nleads south to a room where you hear strange noises or you can go up the steps.',
        "exits": {
            "s": {"to": 6155, "desc": 'the hallway looks quite grand.', "isdoor": True},
            "u": {"to": 6153, "desc": 'the steps appear like they will hold your weight.', "isdoor": True},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
    },
    6155: {
        "name": 'The cultist temple.',
        "desc": "This temple is built to some god that you don't worship.  It is a nice place\nto visit but you feel very uncomfortable about spending much time here.\nThe wooden altar seems almost to glow as you enter the room.  The only exit is\nthe way you came in.",
        "exits": {
            "n": {"to": 6154, "desc": 'the hallway looks quite grand.', "isdoor": True},
        },
        "flags": {"dark": True, "indoors": True},
        "sector": 'forest',
    },
}

